 ruda Purana ancestral strands\; panchanga practice\nWhy: when the moon is 
 dark\, turn attention to those who came before.\nModern angle: Scheduled g
 rief/remembrance days aid mourning culture\; cultural/psychological.\nEvid
 ence: Cultural/psychological\nMore: https://saumya-sharma.github.io/dharma
 setu/review/reasoning.html#shraddha-remembrance\nLocation basis: New Delhi
 . City-specific timing coming later.
