CATEGORIES:sankranti
DESCRIPTION:Why: mark the solar backbone of the lunisolar year with charity
  and Surya arghya.\n\nStory: Sankranti is the Sun's ingress into a new sid
 ereal rasi — a real solar milestone used across regional calendars.\nSou
 rce: Surya Siddhanta\nWhy: mark the solar backbone of the lunisolar year w
 ith charity and Surya arghya.\nModern angle: Astronomically established so
 lar-longitude crossing (with ayanamsa convention).\nEvidence: Established\
 nLink: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sankranti\nMore: https://saumya-sharm
 a.github.io/dharmasetu/review/reasoning.html#sankranti-solar-ingress\nLoca
 tion basis: New Delhi. City-specific timing coming later.
LOCATION:New Delhi\, India (reference)
