  and bilva offerings.\nSource: Shiva Purana\; Linga Purana\nWhy: a night v
 igil of remembrance and restraint at the dark fortnight's edge\, tradition
 ally linked to Shiva's cosmic dance and marriage lore.\nModern angle: Nigh
 t-vigil fasting overlaps with researched intermittent-fasting windows\; ev
